  "_note": "Labelled evaluation set for cluster quality. Ships inside the admin and worker images (config/ is COPYied by both); tests/ is not, which is why the accuracies were absent from every production run before 2026-08-16. same_trend pairs are [semantic_cluster_id, semantic_cluster_id]; same_story/different_story would be [post_id, post_id]. A pair scores only when BOTH ids resolve in the run being measured, so pairs from one workspace are skipped by the others rather than silently counted correct. Each category needs at least 30 RESOLVED pairs before an accuracy is emitted; below that only the resolved count is recorded. Candidates come from scripts/build_cluster_golden_candidates.py, which pairs each sampled cluster with its single closest neighbour and keeps those within a band straddling the trend threshold — the pairs where the answer is genuinely in doubt.",
